examine[Index card on the mirror]: A prayer list in her neat print. 'Walt - his knee. The Okoros - a baby? Ines - her eyes. Hollis & Ellen. {HERO} - everything.' 'Everything' is underlined twice.

== C1_OBJ_STAIR_CREAK
examine[Fourth stair]: It creaks. It has always creaked. You used to skip it sneaking out at sixteen. She always knew anyway.

