== C1_OBJ_MOM_SLIPPERS
examine[Slippers]: Under the table. Both of them. Side by side, like she just stepped up out of them.

== C1_OBJ_MOM_GLASSES_NIGHT
examine[Reading glasses]: On the open Bible. Folded. She always folds them.

== C1_OBJ_MOM_PHONE_NIGHT
examine[Mom's phone]: On the table. 23 messages in the 'Thursday Bible Study' group. The last one was sent at 9:02 PM by Hollis: 'Praying for all of you tonight, friends. Something in my spirit says look up.' Nothing after.

== C1_OBJ_BIBLE_OPEN
examine[Mom's Bible (open)]: Open to First Thessalonians, chapter four. Something is tucked inside, an envelope.

== C1_OBJ_TV_NIGHT
examine[TV]: 'BREAKING: MILLIONS REPORTED MISSING WORLDWIDE.' The anchor's chair is empty. A producer is standing in shot, staring at it.

== C1_OBJ_STOVE_NIGHT
examine[The stove]: Off. She turned it off. Of course she did.

== C1_OBJ_PORCH_LIGHT
examine[Porch light switch]: On. 'I'll leave the light on.' You don't touch it.

