== C1_OBJ_WINDOW_DAWN
examine[Window]: Linden Court in grey light. The Okoros' SUV, black and burned out. Noah's bike, upright now: someone stood it up against the lamppost. Walt is asleep in his rocking chair with the shotgun across his knees.

== C1_OBJ_FRIDGE_DAWN
examine[Fridge]: Warm. The milk you brought home is going to spoil by noon. The crayon drawing is still there. 'BEST LIBERRIAN.'

== C1_OBJ_CANDY
examine[Peanut butter cups]: You bought them for her. You put them on her plate. You don't know why.

# ---- C1_S13: The Broadcast

== C1_S13.station_1_emergency
~ sfx emergency_broadcast_tone
radio: [TONE]
radio: This is an emergency alert for all residents of the tri-state area.
radio: At approximately 9:03 PM Eastern last night, a large number of persons were reported missing worldwide.
radio: The cause is unknown. Officials ask the public to remain calm and remain indoors.
radio: Do not attempt to travel. Major roads, bridges and tunnels into New York City are closed.
radio: Boil all tap water. Do not call emergency services unless there is an immediate threat to life.
radio: Report missing persons through your local relief center when it opens. Further information will follow.
radio: [TONE]

== C1_S13.station_2_ridge_radio
radio: ...still here. Ridge Radio. It's me, it's just me, the engineer's gone. Or. I don't know.
radio: Callers. Line one, you're on.
radio: CALLER: It's the rapture. My grandmother told me. My grandmother TOLD me!
radio: CALLER: That's ridiculous. It's an attack. Some kind of weapon. They hit the cities first.
~ wait 1.0
radio: CALLER: Then why'd they take my baby? Why would a weapon take my BABY?
~ wait 2.0
radio: ...Okay. Okay. Let's. Let's take a minute.
radio: Shelter at the middle school gym is open. Bring blankets. Bring water if you have it.
radio: And if your kids are gone... I'm sorry. I'm so sorry. Mine too.

== C1_S13.station_3_far_station
radio: ...I've been saying this for YEARS, folks. They're not gone. They're TAKEN. Up. Into a ship.
radio: Why do you think the planes fell? Why do you think the satellites went dark at 9:02?
radio: CALLER: Some people are saying fallen angels, that the Nephilim—
radio: We are NOT doing angels on this show. We're doing facts. Next caller.

== C1_S13.feed_murmur
feed: @ridgewatch: anyone on linden ct?? the hale house porch light was on all night then went out w the grid. pls tell me someone's ok
feed: @nightnurse_ana: 3 doctors gone mid-surgery at my hospital. ALL the newborns in the NICU. I can't. I can't.
feed: @truthseeker_0: GOVERNMENT EXPERIMENT. A frequency test went wrong. Watch my video before they delete it.
feed: @grace_notes_77: Matthew 24:40. 'Then shall two be in the field; the one shall be taken, and the other left.' I was left. I knew better. I knew better.
feed: @alt_skywatch: UNEXPLAINED LIGHT over the ocean at 9:03, five witnesses. Not saying aliens. Saying not NOT aliens.
feed: @marketpulse: Trading halted globally. Payment systems 'experiencing interruptions.' Stock up on whatever you can, people.
feed: @halvern_moms: Has anyone seen Ines Albright? Her dog was found by the alley. Her glasses were on the sidewalk.
feed: @worldnews_relay: Leaders call for emergency summit. 'Humanity must stand together,' said one envoy. Names of attendees to follow.

